an awkward situation.

00:09:00.106 --> 00:09:01.240 line:92%
-I appreciate that, yeah.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:04.544
I mean, I feel like I can
dig my own hole for myself

00:09:04.544 --> 00:09:07.313
